135	 * Normalize GitHub repos + collaborators into engine resources. Each repo keyed
136	 * on its normalized `owner/repo`; each collaborator claims github_user_id (+
137	 * github_login). Repos with an unparseable full name, and collaborators with no
138	 * valid identity, are dropped.
