  8	 * authz program (docs/plans/authz-acl-permission-program.md §4) applied to chat
  9	 * recall: the existing per-agent channel fence is one side (the agent only sees
 10	 * its bound channels); this is the other (the user only sees channels they
 11	 * belong to). The two INTERSECT — an agent acting for a user never widens past
 12	 * either bound.
